id: fullstack-backend-integration
title: Backend Engineering Sub-Roadmap
roadmapId: fullstack-developer
type: subroadmap
targetSubroadmap: backend-development
difficulty: Intermediate
estimatedMinutes: 100
summary: Connect client frontends to robust C/Python/Java backend APIs with schema synchronization and contract testing.
explanation: Integrating frontend client applications with backend APIs demands rigorous data validation, API versioning, error payload standardization, and handling offline/network-disconnect states gracefully.
codeExample: async function updateProgress(topicId, status) {\n  const res = await fetch('/api/progress', {\n    method: 'POST',\n    headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\n    body: JSON.stringify({ topicId, status })\n  });\n  return res.json();\n}
objective: Consume and render RESTful JSON resources in client interfaces
objective: Synchronize client state with backend REST mutations
objective: Implement resilient UI error boundaries and offline indicators
pitfall: Trusting client-side validation alone without enforcing server-side checks
pitfall: Failing to handle backend network latency with optimistic UI updates or loading spinners
