objective: Use lambdas with functional interfaces
objective: Build readable filter-map-reduce pipelines
pitfall: Using raw types and losing type safety
pitfall: Assuming a stream can be reused after a terminal operation
pitfall: Creating complex pipelines that obscure behavior
