explanation: Build tools such as Maven and Gradle resolve dependencies, compile source code, and run test suites. Unit tests isolate small behaviors and use assertions to make expected results explicit. A reliable project keeps test execution reproducible from a clean checkout.
codeExample: @Test\nvoid addsTwoNumbers() {\n    assertEquals(5, Calculator.add(2, 3));\n}
