roadmapId: fullstack-developer
type: standard
targetSubroadmap: 
difficulty: Intermediate
estimatedMinutes: 55
summary: Validate user input on both client and server and communicate errors clearly.
explanation: Client-side validation improves feedback but is not a security boundary. The server must validate all incoming data, enforce business rules, and return stable error structures. Forms should preserve valid input where possible and associate messages with the relevant fields.
codeExample: const payload = {\n  email: form.email.trim(),\n  displayName: form.displayName.trim(),\n};\n// The server must validate this payload again.
