codeExample: GET /api/v1/projects\n# Keep response fields stable while clients migrate.
objective: Identify breaking and non-breaking API changes
objective: Choose a versioning and deprecation strategy
objective: Use schema validation and contract tests
pitfall: Changing response meaning without a version change
pitfall: Removing fields before clients have migrated
pitfall: Treating documentation as a substitute for tests
prerequisites: backend-restful-api-design
resource: OpenAPI Specification|https://spec.openapis.org/oas/latest.html|standard
resource: Google API Design Guide|https://cloud.google.com/apis/design|guide

