roadmapId: cloud-engineer
type: standard
targetSubroadmap: 
difficulty: Intermediate
estimatedMinutes: 90
summary: Choose virtual machines, managed runtimes, object storage, and block or file storage based on workload needs.
explanation: Compute and storage choices trade off operational control, scaling behavior, durability, latency, and cost. Workload requirements should drive selection rather than choosing a service by familiarity.
codeExample: 
objective: Compare VM and managed compute
objective: distinguish object, block, and file storage
objective: identify durability and backup needs.
pitfall: Treating replication as a backup
