roadmapId: cloud-engineer
type: standard
targetSubroadmap: 
difficulty: Intermediate
estimatedMinutes: 75
summary: Build event-driven functions with explicit permissions, retries, timeouts, and idempotent processing.
explanation: Serverless platforms manage much of the underlying infrastructure but introduce limits around execution duration, concurrency, and event delivery. Handlers should tolerate retries and duplicate events.
