targetSubroadmap: 
difficulty: Beginner
estimatedMinutes: 60
summary: Translate requirements into test conditions, test cases, boundary checks, and risk-based coverage.
explanation: Testing provides evidence about quality but cannot prove the absence of every defect. Test design should prioritize likely failure modes and high-impact behavior.
