explanation: Animation state machines manage transitions between movement and action states. Animation events can synchronize effects with frames, but gameplay correctness should not depend on fragile visual timing alone.
codeExample: 
objective: Build an animation state machine
objective: define transition conditions
objective: synchronize effects and actions.
pitfall: Creating contradictory transitions
pitfall: tying core damage logic only to animation timing.
prerequisites: game-physics-collision
resource: Unity Animation Manual|https://docs.unity3d.com/Manual/AnimationSection.html|documentation

