difficulty: Intermediate
estimatedMinutes: 90
summary: Implement finite-state behavior, steering, navigation meshes, and pathfinding for non-player characters.
explanation: Game AI often uses simple decision structures and navigation algorithms rather than machine learning. Pathfinding cost functions and navigation constraints affect both behavior and performance.
codeExample: 
objective: Model finite states
objective: explain graph search for navigation
objective: tune behavior for predictable gameplay.
pitfall: Recomputing every path every frame
