id: aieng-model-selection
title: Selecting Models for an AI Application
roadmapId: ai-engineer
type: standard
targetSubroadmap: 
difficulty: Intermediate
estimatedMinutes: 45
summary: Choose a model or hosted AI service based on task fit, privacy, latency, quality, and cost.
explanation: Compare candidate models using representative tasks and acceptance criteria. Distinguish model capability from application reliability: retrieval, validation, user experience, and fallback logic may matter as much as raw benchmark scores.
codeExample: 
objective: Write a model-selection scorecard
objective: Test representative and edge-case inputs
objective: Document privacy and data-retention constraints
pitfall: Selecting only by benchmark rank
