id: aieng-inference-api
title: Inference APIs and Application Boundaries
roadmapId: ai-engineer
type: standard
targetSubroadmap: 
difficulty: Intermediate
estimatedMinutes: 55
summary: Integrate model inference behind a maintainable application boundary.
explanation: Keep provider-specific calls behind an adapter, set timeouts, handle rate limits, validate response shapes, and distinguish retryable failures from permanent errors. Log request metadata without exposing secrets or unnecessary user content.
codeExample: 
objective: Build a provider adapter interface
objective: Handle timeouts, throttling, and malformed responses
objective: Test failure and fallback behavior
pitfall: Unbounded retries that multiply cost
pitfall: Tightly coupling application logic to one provider response format
