id: aieng-evaluation
title: Evaluating AI Application Quality
roadmapId: ai-engineer
type: standard
targetSubroadmap: 
difficulty: Advanced
estimatedMinutes: 60
summary: Build a repeatable evaluation set for correctness, usefulness, safety, and operational performance.
explanation: Use curated representative examples, expected behaviors, adversarial cases, and human review for ambiguous judgments. Automated model-based grading can help scale evaluation but requires calibration against human judgments and can share the same blind spots as the model under test.
codeExample: 
objective: Create a versioned evaluation dataset
objective: Track quality, latency, and cost together
objective: Review disagreements and regression cases
pitfall: Evaluating only with hand-picked happy paths
pitfall: Changing prompts without rerunning regression tests
prerequisites: aieng-tool-use
resource: MLflow GenAI evaluation|https://mlflow.org/docs/latest/genai/eval-monitor/|documentation
resource: Hugging Face Evaluate|https://huggingface.co/docs/evaluate/index|documentation

