id: sre-incident-response
title: Incident Response and Postmortems
roadmapId: site-reliability-engineer
type: standard
targetSubroadmap: 
difficulty: Intermediate
estimatedMinutes: 60
summary: Coordinate mitigation, communication, and learning during service incidents.
explanation: Incident response assigns roles, establishes a shared timeline, prioritizes mitigation, and communicates impact. A blameless postmortem records contributing conditions, detection gaps, and prioritized follow-up actions without reducing the event to individual fault.
codeExample: 
objective: Use a severity and escalation model
objective: Maintain a timeline and stakeholder updates
objective: Write actionable post-incident findings
pitfall: Prioritizing blame over systemic causes
pitfall: Closing a postmortem without owners or due dates
