codeExample: # ADR-004: Choose a modular monolith

Status: Accepted
Context: Small team; one deployment unit is sufficient.
Decision: Keep modules separated behind explicit interfaces.
Consequences: Simpler operations now; revisit if independent scaling becomes necessary.
